Value Required BOARD (MainBoard|Slot \d+)
Value CURRENT_FILE (\S+)
Value NEXT_MAIN_FILE (\S+)
Value NEXT_BACKUP_FILE (\S+)

Start
  ^${BOARD}:
  ^\s*Current startup saved-configuration file:\s*${CURRENT_FILE}
  ^\s*Next main startup saved-configuration file:\s*${NEXT_MAIN_FILE}
  ^\s*Next backup startup saved-configuration file:\s*${NEXT_BACKUP_FILE} -> Record

EOF
